Gaspar Caetano is a gaunt, pale dhampir with sharp fangs and deep, dark circles beneath his eyes, wearing a heavy leather coat lined with formaldehyde-scented specimen pouches.

Gaspar is a member of [[Org/NecroLog/index|NecroLog]].
